  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (multimodal, pca_n2000, imagenet_vit_l, avgpool, concat) achieved 62.87% accuracy. This experiment tests switching to resnet50 image encoder (cheaper) and weighted fusion (which may capture stronger modality interactions) while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation the same. Weighted fusion could improve accuracy over concat, and resnet50 reduces cost compared to vit_l. Expected cost is similar to config_001 (4.54 GPU hours), balancing exploration of fusion methods with budget constraints."
